reading guide: for quantile-preprocessed runs, judge on corr_* and
c2st_auc; js/w1 match by construction. dcr_ratio << 1 or copy_frac
high = memorization, disqualifying regardless of other scores; c2st_auc
well BELOW 0.5 is also a memorization signature (copies pass as real).
